Subject: [PATCH] Preserve Alps CXI and ROCm 10 EP fixes on UCCL 18b588a

Reconcile vLLM common UCCL patches 1-3 (physical GPU rank selection,
serialized barrier cleanup, serialized CXI initialization) and ROCm patches
1-4 (ROCR HMEM, HIP extended launch, volatile-head snapshots, device math).
All seven fixes remain needed at 18b588a048a3a3fe3d4bd60aa5678c66e284df31.
The old ROCm runtime top-k capacity patch is omitted: that fix is upstream.
The pinned source preserves the device-memory D2H handle table fix, avoiding
managed-memory eviction faults during training combine.

